"text": "Stop dragging windows around on Windows 11.\nPress Windows and Z.\nPick a layout, then pick a spot.\nClick another app to fill the gap.\nNot working?\nGo to Settings, System, Multitasking, and turn on Snap windows.\nFollow for more Windows tips.\nAnd stop dragging windows around."
